=== WHY THE BOOT-PATH FIGURE IS NOT ONE FIXED NUMBER ===

The boot path measures 2143 KB / 20 chunks in the CI-faithful shape and
2029 KB / 19 chunks with the sibling present - one chunk and 114 KB further
out of the static closure. The sibling did not move (same commit, clean
packages/), so this is the chunk graph itself, not drift. The only chunk
that differs between the two shapes is qmr-mini-chip-mount (0.20 KB stub vs
88.70 KB real); the with-sibling build carries 211 chunks against 207. The
practical consequence is benign: the cap that bites is the stricter one,
because CI measures the CI-faithful shape.

